    manufacturerTitle: "Bevosita ishlab chiqaruvchi",
    manufacturerText:
      "Mahsulot, narx va buyurtma talablari uchun VIRELLAART jamoasi bilan to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri bog‘laning.",
